## 🔄 Request Flow

```
HTTP Request
    ↓
routes/admin/dashboard.routes.js  ← Defines endpoints
    ↓
middleware/auth.middleware.js     ← Verify JWT token
    ↓
middleware/role.middleware.js     ← Check user role (admin/user/provider)
    ↓
middleware/validation.middleware.js ← Validate request data
    ↓
controllers/admin/dashboard.controller.js ← Handle request
    ↓
services/admin/admin.service.js   ← Business logic
    ↓
models/User.model.js              ← Database query
    ↓
utils/response.js                 ← Format response
    ↓
HTTP Response
```

