## 📊 Module Organization

### **Authentication Module**
```
Routes: /api/auth/login, /api/auth/register
Controller: auth.controller.js
Service: auth.service.js, token.service.js
Models: User.model.js
```

### **Admin Module**
```
Routes: /api/admin/dashboard, /api/admin/users, /api/admin/providers
Controllers: dashboard.controller.js, user.management.controller.js
Services: None (uses models directly)
Models: User.model.js, Admin.model.js, Payment.model.js
Middleware: role.middleware.js (admin only)
```

### **User Module**
```
Routes: /api/users/profile, /api/users/bookings
Controllers: profile.controller.js, booking.controller.js
Services: None
Models: User.model.js, Booking.model.js
Middleware: role.middleware.js (user only)
```

### **Provider Module**
```
Routes: /api/providers/profile, /api/providers/services, /api/providers/bookings
Controllers: profile.controller.js, service.controller.js, availability.controller.js
Services: None
Models: Provider.model.js, Service.model.js, Booking.model.js
Middleware: role.middleware.js (provider only)
```

### **Booking Module**
```
Routes: /api/bookings
Controllers: booking.controller.js
Services: booking.service.js (business logic)
Models: Booking.model.js, Payment.model.js
```

### **Chat Module**
```
Routes: /api/chat
Controllers: chat.controller.js, message.controller.js
Services: chat.service.js, socket.service.js
Models: ChatRoom.model.js, ChatMessage.model.js
Real-time: Socket.io
```

### **Payment Module**
```
Routes: /api/payments
Controllers: payment.controller.js
Services: stripe.service.js
Models: Payment.model.js, Booking.model.js
```

